se confirm before it goes in the steering committee history.\n\n**Things to check before the steering committee**\n\n- **#8841 has three different descriptions and statuses.** The 7/1 message says it was closed. The 5/4 digest says Allentown kiosk timeout and still open. The 9/30 digest says Newark carrier portal and escalated. It may be one ticket that was reused, or several with the same number. The ticket system would settle it.\n- **Ticket history is incomplete.** The Moss digests list tickets only in passing, and the Hartford thread doesn't give a closing date for INC-4821.\n- **Dates without ticket numbers:** the 3/10/2025 digest has a Vantorre Group gate check-in delay email from Mateo, and the 8/3/2026 digest covers the Hartford Sev 1 with no number.\n\nI haven't posted anything to other channels or sent any mail."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
